  "verbatim_excerpt": "32-131 Use Group III – general use allowances\n\nThe following tables include #uses# classified as Use Group III and set forth their allowances by #Commercial District#. Such #uses# are categorized as #community facilities# with and without sleeping accommodations, as provided in paragraphs A and B of this Section. Notations found in the tables are further described in Section 32-10 (USE ALLOWANCES).\n\nA. Community Facilities with Sleeping Accommodations\n\n[table - see structured `table` field]\n\nB. Community Facilities without Sleeping Accommodations\n\n[table - see structured `table` field]",
  "verbatim_excerpt_composition": "Verbatim blocks joined by a blank line, in page order: [0] the displayed section number and title; then each body paragraph/list item. Defined terms (bold-italic in the HTML) are written #term#. Ordered-list item labels are the labels the section's own print/PDF prints (nesting depth: (a)/(b)..., then (1)/(2)..., then (i)/(ii)...); the HTML renders them as CSS markers. A superscript footnote marker is written ^N. Runs of whitespace and non-breaking spaces are written as one space and each block is trimmed; embedded figures omitted; tables replaced by a '[table - see structured `tables` field]' placeholder and carried cell-by-cell. No word changed.",
